@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber
participant User
participant DBSystem
participant TargetDatabase
participant SourceDatabases

User->>DBSystem: Select Target Database
activate DBSystem

User->>DBSystem: Select Source Databases (Multiple)
DBSystem->>SourceDatabases: Retrieve Source Database Details

User->>DBSystem: Define Data Federation Configuration
DBSystem->>DBSystem: Validate Data Federation Configuration

alt Configuration Valid
    DBSystem->>TargetDatabase: Establish Data Federation Connection
    DBSystem->>User: Success Message
else
    DBSystem->>User: Error Message
end

deactivate DBSystem
@enduml